# Intraday snapshots. `data/es_data.json` is tracked on purpose — it is the
# artifact's whole dataset and the desktop app's offline seed — but an intraday
# pull is a 60-day rolling window, so a committed one is stale within a day and
# worthless within two months. Fetch it with `npm run data -- --interval 5m`.
data/es_5m*.json
